                                                "sense_id": "5b8d7155-86da-3dc9-a96f-19d36e13d7c7",
                                                "text": "[…]where you should put the disclaimer for software (somewhere that the user sees it when they start the program, tho' I wouldn't do that, just put it in the 'about' box like the mpgn.com guy suggests -- otherwise, having something pop up makes it annoyware, IMHO)."
                                            }
